version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-02"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ktwyw/engstoch"
keywords:
  - stochastic processes
  - simulation
  - Monte Carlo
  - quasi-Monte Carlo
  - Markov chains
  - queueing theory
  - discrete-event simulation
  - stochastic differential equations
  - Markov chain Monte Carlo
  - engineering education
abstract: >-
  A from-scratch, validated NumPy implementation of stochastic processes and simulation: pseudo-random
  generators and their tests, random variate generation, Monte Carlo with variance reduction and quasi-Monte
  Carlo, discrete- and continuous-time Markov chains, random walks and branching processes, Poisson and renewal
  processes, queueing theory and discrete-event simulation, output analysis, Brownian motion and stochastic
  differential equations with multilevel Monte Carlo, Gaussian processes and time series, and Markov chain Monte
  Carlo, with course data and a 20-notebook course with worked solutions.
